  m_text: "<color=#FFE07D><b>MOVEMENT</b></color>\n\u2022 <b>Walk / Strafe:</b> Left Thumbstick\n\u2022 <b>Teleport:</b> Push Right Stick Forward & Release\n\u2022 <b>Turn (45\xB0):</b> Flick Right Stick Left / Right\n\n<color=#5CFFA0><b>OBJECTS & UI</b></color>\n\u2022 <b>Grab / Hold:</b> Left or Right Grip\n\u2022 <b>Spin / Pull Held Item:</b> Stick while Ray-Grabbing\n\u2022 <b>Buttons / Sliders / UI:</b> Trigger or Index Poke\n\n<color=#38D8FF><b>TABLET & MENU</b></color>\n\u2022 <b>Lab Tablet:</b> Left <b>Y</b>   |   <b>Menu (Exit/Restart):</b> Left <b>X</b>"
